    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2310100/extras/2b868c6f2d01bf0792e6bd87c15d25bb.avif?t=1714024607\" /></span><br>Your mission as the mercenary is to clean the unforeseen consequences of the dangerous experiment resulting in the vast majority of mutants in the area. You have access to the self-recharging jetpack, a variety of flamethrowers and other fire weapons, beware of the traps and monsters on the levels. <br><strong>The mutants only fear the fire!</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MAIN FEATURES</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Travel through colorful and perilous biomes.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2310100/extras/fb1ad36620944889d936d4bddab6d672.poster.avif?t=1714024607\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2310100/extras/fb1ad36620944889d936d4bddab6d672.webm?t=1714024607\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2310100/extras/fb1ad36620944889d936d4bddab6d672.mp4?t=1714024607\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br></li><li>Use various fire-based blazing weaponry.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2310100/extras/d11d0b69e1d1180c3da06bc94466a593.poster.avif?t=1714024607\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2310100/extras/d11d0b69e1d1180c3da06bc94466a593.webm?t=1714024607\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2310100/extras/d11d0b69e1d1180c3da06bc94466a593.mp4?t=1714024607\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br></li><li>Wade through hazardous stages with the multi-mode jetpack.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2310100/extras/10ea3ebc3bc4e4684af157793f872cc3.poster.avif?t=1714024607\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2310100/extras/10ea3ebc3bc4e4684af157793f872cc3.webm?t=1714024607\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2310100/extras/10ea3ebc3bc4e4684af157793f872cc3.mp4?t=1714024607\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br></li><li>Cinder rageful bosses and dozens of mutated creatures.</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2310100/extras/4d3ce9551e663d4be572a8f8080309ab.poster.avif?t=1714024607\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2310100/extras/4d3ce9551e663d4be572a8f8080309ab.webm?t=1714024607\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2310100/extras/4d3ce9551e663d4be572a8f8080309ab.mp4?t=1714024607\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><i>The remastered version contains over three dozen fixes, changes, improvements and innovations.</i><br><br><strong>Some of the most important changes are:</strong><br><br>-\tEnemies now run in fear when being burned, impacts with fire from specific attacks will make enemies run in random directions.<br>-\tYou can now use the jetpack to damage enemies!<br>-\tAdded a descent mode for the jetpack, which will be useful in platforming.<br>-\tHaptic feedback on most of the actions and unique haptic feedback pattern for every weapon when playing with a gamepad.<br>-\tIncreased jetpack recharge speed.<br>-\tMore clear visual indication on dealing damage to enemies besides setting them on fire.<br>-\tBalanced the number of enemies on levels for smoother progression.<br>-\tMore pickups on levels.<br>-\tA clearer indication of the bosses\u2019 melee attacks.<br>-\tSome user interface improvements.<br>-\tAdded an automatic reload.<br>-\tAdded pitfall indications.<br>-\tMore frequent saves of the player progress.<br>-\tA slight secret areas indication.<br>-\tImproved fire effects.<br>-\tAbility to zoom out for better observation.<br>-\tA new soundtrack for whole game!<br><br>And many more.",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2310100/extras/2b868c6f2d01bf0792e6bd87c15d25bb.avif?t=1714024607\" /></span><br>Your mission as the mercenary is to clean the unforeseen consequences of the dangerous experiment resulting in the vast majority of mutants in the area. You have access to the self-recharging jetpack, a variety of flamethrowers and other fire weapons, beware of the traps and monsters on the levels. <br><strong>The mutants only fear the fire!</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MAIN FEATURES</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Travel through colorful and perilous biomes.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2310100/extras/fb1ad36620944889d936d4bddab6d672.poster.avif?t=1714024607\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2310100/extras/fb1ad36620944889d936d4bddab6d672.webm?t=1714024607\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2310100/extras/fb1ad36620944889d936d4bddab6d672.mp4?t=1714024607\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br></li><li>Use various fire-based blazing weaponry.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2310100/extras/d11d0b69e1d1180c3da06bc94466a593.poster.avif?t=1714024607\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2310100/extras/d11d0b69e1d1180c3da06bc94466a593.webm?t=1714024607\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2310100/extras/d11d0b69e1d1180c3da06bc94466a593.mp4?t=1714024607\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br></li><li>Wade through hazardous stages with the multi-mode jetpack.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2310100/extras/10ea3ebc3bc4e4684af157793f872cc3.poster.avif?t=1714024607\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2310100/extras/10ea3ebc3bc4e4684af157793f872cc3.webm?t=1714024607\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2310100/extras/10ea3ebc3bc4e4684af157793f872cc3.mp4?t=1714024607\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br></li><li>Cinder rageful bosses and dozens of mutated creatures.</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2310100/extras/4d3ce9551e663d4be572a8f8080309ab.poster.avif?t=1714024607\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2310100/extras/4d3ce9551e663d4be572a8f8080309ab.webm?t=1714024607\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2310100/extras/4d3ce9551e663d4be572a8f8080309ab.mp4?t=1714024607\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><i>The remastered version contains over three dozen fixes, changes, improvements and innovations.</i><br><br><strong>Some of the most important changes are:</strong><br><br>-\tEnemies now run in fear when being burned, impacts with fire from specific attacks will make enemies run in random directions.<br>-\tYou can now use the jetpack to damage enemies!<br>-\tAdded a descent mode for the jetpack, which will be useful in platforming.<br>-\tHaptic feedback on most of the actions and unique haptic feedback pattern for every weapon when playing with a gamepad.<br>-\tIncreased jetpack recharge speed.<br>-\tMore clear visual indication on dealing damage to enemies besides setting them on fire.<br>-\tBalanced the number of enemies on levels for smoother progression.<br>-\tMore pickups on levels.<br>-\tA clearer indication of the bosses\u2019 melee attacks.<br>-\tSome user interface improvements.<br>-\tAdded an automatic reload.<br>-\tAdded pitfall indications.<br>-\tMore frequent saves of the player progress.<br>-\tA slight secret areas indication.<br>-\tImproved fire effects.<br>-\tAbility to zoom out for better observation.<br>-\tA new soundtrack for whole game!<br><br>And many more.",
